COMMENT ON FUNCTION "public"."place_chapter_on_board"("chapter_code" "text", "act_id" "text", "chapter_codes" "text"[], "confirmed" boolean) IS 'Saves a move on the caller''s storyline board: the new order and the act; asks first when readers would notice (S1-E17-19).';



